      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَذَّحَتْ خَاصِرَتَاهُ</span></b>  <i>His two hypochrondres,</i>
or <i>flanks, became inflated,</i> or <i>swollen, by reason
of his having satiated himself with drink.</i> (K.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَدَّحَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَدَّحَ</span>.]

